#: ../../site/conventions.md:1
msgid "Data and numerical conventions"
msgstr "数据与数值约定"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:3
msgid "Frames and time"
msgstr "数据帧与时间"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:5
msgid ""
"The native `fincore::dataframe` is a `hmdf::StdDataFrame` whose index is a "
"signed 64-bit UTC nanosecond timestamp. Index order and uniqueness are "
"validated by the individual APIs; do not assume that every function sorts or "
"deduplicates implicitly."
msgstr ""
"原生 `fincore::dataframe` 是一个 `hmdf::StdDataFrame`，其索引为带符号的 64 "
"位 UTC 纳秒时间戳。索引顺序与唯一性由各个 API 分别校验；不要假设每个函数都会"
"隐式排序或去重。"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:10
msgid "Returns, units and annualization"
msgstr "收益率、单位与年化"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:12
msgid ""
"Return series are decimal simple returns unless a function states otherwise. "
"`0.01` means one percent. Annualization factors are passed explicitly where "
"an API exposes them; `daily_annualization` is 252. Portfolio weights, prices "
"and amounts carry their call-site units and are not converted implicitly."
msgstr ""
"除非函数另有说明，收益率序列均为小数形式的简单收益率。`0.01` 表示百分之一。"
"在 API 暴露年化因子的地方，年化因子需显式传入；`daily_annualization` 为 252。"
"投资组合权重、价格和金额沿用调用处的单位，不会被隐式换算。"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:17
msgid "Missing values and alignment"
msgstr "缺失值与对齐"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:19
msgid ""
"`NaN` is the native missing numeric marker. Multi-input APIs document their "
"alignment policy: strict equality, common index, inner join, or an explicit "
"outer policy. A missing label is not silently replaced with zero. Windowed "
"metrics state their warm-up and complete-window rules in the API reference."
msgstr ""
"`NaN` 是原生的数值缺失标记。多输入 API 会在文档中说明其对齐策略：严格相等、公"
"共索引、内连接或显式的外连接策略。缺失的标签不会被静默替换为零。窗口类指标在 "
"API 参考中说明了其预热期与完整窗口规则。"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:24
msgid "Randomness"
msgstr "随机性"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:26
msgid ""
"Simulation and bootstrap APIs accept an explicit seed where documented. A "
"matching seed is not a cross-language RNG-identity claim unless the "
"reference implementation is also the pinned algorithm. Read each result's "
"failure status and diagnostics instead of assuming convergence."
msgstr ""
"模拟和自助法（bootstrap）API 在文档说明之处接受显式随机种子。除非参考实现也采"
"用所固定的算法，否则相同的随机种子并不构成跨语言 RNG 一致性的声明。请查看每个"
"结果的失败状态和诊断信息，而不是假定其已收敛。"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:31
msgid "Reports and files"
msgstr "报告与文件"

#: ../../site/conventions.md:33
msgid ""
"Report schema versions and artifact-bundle manifests are separate version "
"domains from the runtime serialization envelope. Writers reject unsafe or "
"preexisting destinations and clean up partial output where documented. CSV "
"is an exchange format; it does not carry the full provenance of a result "
"model."
msgstr ""
"报告 schema 版本和产物包清单是与运行时序列化封装相互独立的版本域。写入器会拒"
"绝不安全或已存在的目标位置，并在文档说明的情况下清理部分输出。CSV 是一种交换"
"格式；它不携带结果模型的完整溯源信息。"
